quran[20]{c,v,t}:
  44,40,"Indeed, the Day of Judgement is the appointed time for all of them."
  44,41,"The Day when a friend will not avail a friend in any way, nor will they be helped,"
  44,42,"except for those to whom Allah has been merciful. (They will intercede for one another.) Indeed, He is the All-Mighty, the All-Merciful."
  44,43,"Indeed, the tree of Zaqqum,*"
  44,44,will be the food of the major sinners.
  44,45,"Like molten copper, it will boil in the bellies,"
  44,46,like the boiling of boiling liquid.
  44,47,(It will be commanded:) ‘Seize him and drag him to the middle of Hell.
  44,48,Then pour over his head the torment of boiling liquid.
  44,49,"Taste (this)! Indeed, you are the (self-claimed) mighty and noble!"
  44,50,"Certainly, this is (the very Hell) you used to doubt.’"
  44,51,"Indeed, the God-conscious will be in a secure place,"
  44,52,"amid gardens and springs,"
  44,53,"dressed in fine silk and rich brocade, sitting face to face."
  44,54,So shall it be. And We shall wed them to pure and beautiful wide-eyed maidens (of Paradise known as al-Hur al-‘In).
  44,55,"Feeling comfortable and secure therein, they will call for every fruit."
  44,56,"There (in Paradise), they will not taste death beyond the first death (which would have passed already). And He will save them from the punishment of Hell,"
  44,57,as a grace from your Lord. That is the ultimate success.
  44,58,"Indeed, We have made this (Qur’an) easy in your (own) language (O Prophet); perhaps they may become mindful of advice."
  44,59,So wait! They (too) are certainly waiting.
